. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 * 
. 
.         * Please add a verbal description of your model here
.         *       Our operationalization ensures ranodmization of the treatment
>  and hence warrants a causal interpretation. Thus, we do not employ further c
> ontrols.
.         *       The only exception are survey waves to control for general tr
> ends in gender equality and trends in birth rates. 
.         *       We use a random effects model with observations clustered at 
> the individual level. We xtset our data. We do not use an OLS since a RE mode
> l is more efficient. 
.         
.         xtset pid syear

